# Widget wikis

Before changing a HUD widget, read its page under `wiki/widgets/`. Index: `wiki/widgets.md`.

| Widget | Wiki |
| --- | --- |
| Standings | `wiki/widgets/standings.md` |
| Relative | `wiki/widgets/relative.md` |
| Map | `wiki/widgets/map.md` |
| Minimap | `wiki/widgets/minimap.md` |
| Radar | `wiki/widgets/radar.md` |
| Dash (clock, extras, flags) | `wiki/widgets/dash.md` |
| Flags | `wiki/widgets/flag.md` |
| Horizontal Standings (`Ticker`) | `wiki/widgets/horizontal-standings.md` |
| Systems | `wiki/widgets/systems.md` |
| Sectors | `wiki/widgets/sector.md` |
| Delta Bar | `wiki/widgets/delta-bar.md` |
| Stance | `wiki/widgets/stance.md` |
| Lean | `wiki/widgets/lean.md` |
| Gamepad | `wiki/widgets/gamepad.md` |

After a behavior, layout, settings, or color change, append a dated bullet to that page’s **Change log** (why, not just what). Update the **Do not regress** list if you add an invariant. Plugin-field status still belongs in `wiki/Home.md`.
